	(text "Slicer: TLV3605 (IN+ = SDET, IN− = VTH), 3V3 VCCI/VCCO individually bypassed, SHDN_N pulled high, LE_HYS hysteresis\\nresistor to GND (150k ≈ 30 mV start), LVDS OUT+/OUT− → LVDS_P/LVDS_N, 100 Ω termination at the FPGA only. Squelch/latch\\npolicy UNRESOLVED."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
